WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.300
Deliveries: each day's deliveries for meal, water and gas plans, and containers.

2
00:00:07.848 --> 00:00:10.270
Pick the day and look at the list.

3
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:15.020
After delivering, click "Delivered"; credits are deducted.

4
00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:22.150
Record returned containers under "Containers back"; "Containers out" shows what's still with the customer.

5
00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:29.270
If a customer wants to skip one, "Skip next"; never mark an undelivered drop as delivered.
